WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.334
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.467
We're hanging out
with Reese Witherspoon,

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:07.133
who stars in "Sing 2."

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.834
You're back as the voice
of Rosita.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:10.934
-Yes.

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:12.267
-Is it fun to get
back with the cast?

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:13.734
I know you did a little press.

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:15.634
-Oh, my gosh.
It's been so much fun.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:17.901
We went and they had
the premiere of the show

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:19.567
and it was all little kids
in a theater,

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:23.000
and they were all standing up
and singing all the songs.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
And I've never been in
a movie where

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.934
I saw people stand up
and sing and cheer,

00:00:26.934 --> 00:00:29.400
and it was just pure magic.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.367
-Did you get nervous
that you had to

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:32.601
perform an Ariana Grande song?

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:37.200
-Yeah, I had to sing
Prince, Ariana Grande, U2.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.400
I was so scared.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.601
-You're like, "Oh, my God,
what is going on?"

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.234
-I was like, "This is
not gonna be good."

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.434
But it was really great.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:47.133
Harvey Mason, he produced it,
and he's amazing.

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:48.534
I was like,
"Make me sound good."

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:49.634
-Yeah.
-"I got you."

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:52.434
-Have you met Ariana?
-Have I met her?

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:53.767
No, I've talked to her,

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.901
because she did
a "Legally Blonde" video.

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.901
She did an homage so Elle Woods,

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.300
which was so
sweet and thoughtful.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.567
-She's one of the most fun --

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:01.834
You would totally
get on with her.

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:04.133
She's so great.
-I really like that, Jimmy.

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.334
Maybe you can, you know,
hook a friend up.

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:08.100
-Yeah, no problem.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.968
I also have his number, as well.
-Okay.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:12.667
-No, look,
he is not in this film,

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:16.267
but Matthew McConaughey is,
Scarlett Johansson.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:19.234
And then the addition
to the cast is Bono.

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:20.567
I know.
-Come on.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:23.868
-Bono, Pharrell, Halsey.
-Oh, yeah, I forgot.

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:25.434
-Halsey has
the most amazing number,

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:26.701
and then we all have --

00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:28.467
there's like, seven
musical numbers at the end

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:30.167
where everybody's
dancing and singing

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:32.701
in these beautiful costumes,
and I'm telling you,

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:34.834
it was like,
everybody was singing.

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:35.868
It was so fun.

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:37.501
-Isn't it fun to
do a movie like that,

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.767
like a big, animated movie
that's just gorgeous

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:40.934
and everyone loves?

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:41.934
We all need it right now.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:42.934
-It's such a dream.

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:44.100
-I want to show everyone
a clip.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.601
Here's Reese Witherspoon
as Rosita in "Sing 2."

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:47.701
Take a look.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.868
-Guys, come on!

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:52.033
Wait!

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.501
[ Tires squeal ]

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:59.567
♪♪

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:01.334
-Listen, you guys.

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:03.734
I have dreamt of performing
in Redshore City

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:05.667
since I was a little kid.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.601
And besides,
I just convinced my husband

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:09.467
to babysit for the next
24 hours,

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:12.334
and I am not gonna waste
an opportunity like that.

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:13.567
So come on!

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:15.300
[ Bag thuds ]
We've got nothing to lose!

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.434
♪♪

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:18.968
-Aww.
-Come on.

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.901
You got nothing to lose!
It's hopeful!

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.968
Go check out this movie.
I loved it.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.601
Reese Witherspoon, everybody!

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:27.801
"Sing 2" opens in theaters
December 22nd.

